WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.350
Where do you start?

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:07.475
Which boards, which titles, which companies?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.775
Your job hunt shouldn't be a full-time job.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.250
Install uv, then install jobwatch with it, and open it.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.580
The first time, it asks a little about you, and for your resume.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.975
Your resume stays on this computer.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.968
Next, the jobs you want: titles, places and pay.

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:38.580
Skip any step and come back later.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:41.049
Then the companies to watch.

00:00:41.049 --> 00:00:44.495
Type a name, or paste a link to one of their jobs.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.723
The last step is where the AI runs.

00:00:48.723 --> 00:00:51.745
Each option tells you what it needs to work.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:59.784
Then you land on Today: your matches, ranked, with fit and pay.

00:00:59.784 --> 00:01:02.170
The filters start where you set them.
